# Space returns early from handle_space and does not interrupt a pending Ctrl tap.
0 in key KEY_CAPSLOCK down
0 out key KEY_LEFTCTRL down
50 in key KEY_SPACE down
100 in key KEY_SPACE up
100 out key KEY_SPACE down
100 out key KEY_SPACE up
150 in key KEY_CAPSLOCK up
150 out key KEY_LEFTCTRL up
150 out key KEY_ESC down
150 out key KEY_ESC up
200 in key KEY_LEFTCTRL down
200 out key KEY_LEFTCTRL down
250 in key KEY_SPACE down
300 in key KEY_SPACE up
300 out key KEY_SPACE down
300 out key KEY_SPACE up
350 in key KEY_LEFTCTRL up
350 out key KEY_LEFTCTRL up
350 out key KEY_ESC down
350 out key KEY_ESC up
